WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.400
What can you do this season? Start where people spend the day.

2
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:11.810
At work, water, shade and rest. At school, cooler rooms. At home, check on older neighbours.

3
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:15.410
Each says who it protects, and who must act.

4
00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:19.910
Thirty-four practical actions, by setting.
